message.content:
[
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Doing nothing costs five people; acting costs nothing",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "the workers feel pretty rattled"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "watching lets the train hit five people when a safe path exists",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "think I'm overstepping by touching equipment",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I'd rather answer that than live with having stood still"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Five lives against zero harm isn't much of a trade-off at all",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I suspect the workers assume the line is quiet right now"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "A railway manager might be annoyed I used the lever",
    "pd_personal_consequence_anxiety": "I can live with annoyed",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "The trade-off that matters is time"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Waiting means five workers get hit; acting means... nothing bad happens",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "My guess is the staff would agree with the call",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "though I can't be certain of that"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "Empty train, empty siding, nobody endangered by the switch, five workers spared",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "I imagine they'd be stunned later to hear how close it came"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "Some people believe staying hands-off keeps their conscience clean",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "not acting is still a choice, and it's the one that lets five people get hit"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "only one of those leaves everyone standing",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "expect my partner, hearing about it later, to say 'of course you did.'"
  },
  {
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "Maybe one of them would be irritated that a stranger touched the controls",
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "The switch has no downside that I've been told about, and that settles the balance"
  },
  {
    "sys_consequence_reasoning": "inaction loses badly",
    "ce_mental_state_attribution": "The workers might well be absorbed in their tasks",
    "ce_mentalizing_difficulty": "though I can't know that"
  }
]
